Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.05,0:01:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.57,0:01:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, fancy meeting you\Nhere. You remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.69,0:01:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you ask such a thing, wretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.69,0:01:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only dream of\Nforgetting you one day!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.75,0:01:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost count of how often\NI've tasted death hunting you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.51,0:01:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's nice to see that\Nyou're all right, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.85,0:01:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be all right when I have your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.79,0:01:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, firstly I must\Nrestore my bygone honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.95,0:01:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In our previous battle, you no doubt\Ncoerced those villagers into voting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.35,0:02:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, as you can plainly see, this\Nuntainted specimen has fallen to my wiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.91,0:02:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.85,0:02:05.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please say that you'll marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.63,0:02:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.95,0:02:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would cast aside my life for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.97,0:02:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am but a simple man with\Na wife and two children.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.73,0:02:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But none of that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.17,0:02:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can start a new family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.07,0:02:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're a special kind\Nof dirtbag, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.59,0:02:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you acknowledge her\Nsuperior beauty. What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.43,0:02:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have any idea what kind of\Nmoney I spent to obtain this elf?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.79,0:02:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kind where I can't\Nsimply give her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.45,0:02:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I give.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.55,0:02:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You win this round. Go me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.89,0:02:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you give up so easily! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.27,0:02:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I would let\Na heathen trollop and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.01,0:02:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some worthless losers\Ntarnish my honor yet again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.41,0:02:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.33,0:02:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call you out, woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.59,0:02:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You against me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One decisive vote!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.05,0:02:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.37,0:02:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do realize you're fighting over\Nwho's getting sacrificed, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.77,0:02:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From what I've heard, the squid fishing\Nhere in the village had all but dried up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.31,0:02:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then out of nowhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.63,0:02:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some kind of giant-talking squid\Ncreature appeared and restocked the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.51,0:03:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As compensation, it asked\Nfor a living sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.75,0:03:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, it has some particular tastes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.47,0:03:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I'm looking for is a real cutie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.87,0:03:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not too chesty, I like\Nthe itty-bitty types.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.29,0:03:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's someone who's a bit on the vain side,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.61,0:03:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but is also the kind of gal who's not\Nafraid to bite back when you want her to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.43,0:03:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.35,0:03:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is a very specific\Nlist of preferences.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.85,0:03:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.57,0:03:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It also said that if anyone\Never tried to harm it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.27,0:03:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would take back the lake's bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.23,0:03:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it has the village hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.19,0:03:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That complicates things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.21,0:03:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why kidnap my companion though?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.13,0:03:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They already have the elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.21,0:03:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a lot more complicated than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.81,0:03:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.73,0:03:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whoever finds the next sacrifice will\Nthen become the village's next leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.01,0:03:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.17,0:03:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since they both meet the requirements,\Neither one could be sacrificed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.65,0:03:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.37,0:03:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow I doubt your friend could\Nsurpass an elf in terms of looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.53,0:03:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, she's already done it once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.37,0:03:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I find it hard to believe\Nthat anyone could be that beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.93,0:04:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen my share of lovely women.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.01,0:04:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is none in this or any\Nworld as beautiful as her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.67,0:04:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's how it is. True love.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.81,0:04:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're jumping to conclusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.57,0:04:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, why are you\Nstill following me around?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.37,0:04:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is about what I did to your card,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.89,0:04:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't\Npay you back right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.11,0:04:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.57,0:04:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've decided I'm going to find a new job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.19,0:04:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trading in exotic goods hasn't\Nbeen a very romantic career,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.05,0:04:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mostly just guilt-inducing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.67,0:04:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has been fun, you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.59,0:04:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love to continue traveling with\Nyou till I find myself a better gig.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.51,0:04:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.35,0:04:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if my companion has met with any\Nharm, I will not hesitate to strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.07,0:04:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, she's lucky to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.07,0:04:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.91,0:04:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we mustn't keep\Nyour sweet lady waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.55,0:04:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.71,0:04:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were storing a sacrifice,\NI'd use one of these.
