Dialogue: 2,0:05:05.03,0:05:09.16,Signs,title,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur1\bord0\shad0\fscx100\fscy100\pos(411,497)\p1\c&H0A0A0A&}m -97 24 l 1239 24 1239 119 -97 119
Dialogue: 3,0:05:05.03,0:05:09.16,Signs,title,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&HF5F5F5&\fnFree Pixel\\fs70\b1\blur0.7\pos(307,497)}A Guy Who Reincarnated as a Fantasy Knockout \Nand a Squid Fire
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.11,0:05:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.05,0:05:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.21,0:05:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right in Rome, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.71,0:05:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why are we eating and not\Nout looking for my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.77,0:05:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know about you, but\NI'm more useful with a full stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.09,0:05:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What better way for us to get to know\Neach other than with a meal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.51,0:05:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.43,0:05:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see no purpose in being\Nfriendly with humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.39,0:05:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially not you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.89,0:05:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your company all but spoils the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.63,0:05:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.53,0:05:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horribly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.03,0:05:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In untold pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.41,0:05:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a meal\Nmake someone so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.73,0:05:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.65,0:05:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think even the squid likes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.69,0:05:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.95,0:05:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you've freed\Nyourself from that harpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.17,0:05:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this your new traveling companion?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.35,0:05:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Recent events brought us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.47,0:06:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But speaking of my friend, I was\Nhoping you could answer something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.69,0:06:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I was captured along with that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.93,0:06:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They moved her before you arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.79,0:06:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's to be sacrificed at the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.81,0:06:12.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will tell me where\Nshe is, my rage? You
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.73,0:06:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have don't tempt me hey\Nlet's all calm down shall
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.21,0:06:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We, I'm not done talking to you yet. Look\Nat me. I need to know where she is, how.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.21,0:06:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,long has it been since I was graced with\Na hot meal I'd long forgotten the comfort
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.99,0:06:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one could bring ever since this lowly\Ncreature busted me i've been captured by
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.39,0:06:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,barbarians nearly killed by shoddy\Ncartography more than once treated as a petty
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.93,0:06:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thief and enslaved and\Nsold to be sacrificed
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.43,0:06:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's humiliating
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.73,0:06:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fine heretic it seems
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.23,0:06:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our only way forward is to form a truce\Na truce i will help you in exchange you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.81,0:07:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will help me get my revenge. Are you aware\Nthat the humans of the village revere?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.43,0:07:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,giant squid creature as a god that in mind\Nimagine what might happen if someone say
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.27,0:07:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,slaughtered the beast right in front\Nof their eyes kill the squid and you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.55,0:07:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wreck the festival and the village along\Nwith it interesting that's a good idea
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.43,0:07:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,interrupting the festival could work in\Nour favor but it won't be as simple as that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.19,0:07:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you know defeating a monster of its size\Nand capabilities without help will be next
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.27,0:07:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to impossible all right let's kill it\Nhey were you even listening to me i had
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.77,0:07:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,already made up my mind to kill the thing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.61,0:07:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before our paths crossed\Nagain splendid not
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.55,0:07:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only is it intelligent it lives in the\Nmiddle of a lake how would you even be able
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.67,0:07:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to draw it out don't worry it'll be all\Nright we've got this just leave it to me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.53,0:07:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to me. Just leave it to me.\NJust leave it to me. I take it from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.29,0:08:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,look in your eye that you have a plan\NI do one that requires your assistance
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.99,0:08:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if we're going to do this we need to be\Nable to trust each other implicitly will
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.81,0:08:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you give me your word not to run when\Nthe time comes this man has an enemy he's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flexing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.41,0:08:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as an ally, he's reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.23,0:08:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, comforting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.79,0:08:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's smart, strong, level-headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.45,0:08:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in the right light,\Nhe's almost handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.65,0:08:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, on the name of my great goddess,\Nyou have my full support in this endeavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.89,0:08:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I see this is what you\Nmeant when you said trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.93,0:08:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I ask what I'm tied to at least?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.43,0:08:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Floats. Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.31,0:08:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're fishing for squid, and\Nwe need bait, so here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.27,0:08:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's hoping you don't drown.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.33,0:08:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.87,0:08:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a freaky heretic!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was a fool to trust a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.61,0:09:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is quite the plan\Nyou've come up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.15,0:09:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.53,0:09:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, it does also beg a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.19,0:09:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The biggest of which being how you\Nwere able to throw her that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.31,0:09:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.23,0:09:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have been able to get her\Nat least a bit further from shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.91,0:09:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.47,0:09:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.41,0:09:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you have been under\Na lot of stress lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.53,0:09:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could work some of that out\Nfor you if you'd be up for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.05,0:09:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.13,0:09:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly fine. Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.71,0:09:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am quite skilled. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.71,0:09:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see any need for\Nyou to be that close.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.47,0:09:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.39,0:09:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like some dried squid?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.45,0:09:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, silly me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.55,0:09:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have your hands full.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.47,0:09:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, I can just\Nfeed it to you. Say, ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.73,0:09:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just the two of us now,\Nso let's have a little fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.93,0:09:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Tachibana.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.39,0:09:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will kill this squid\Nand then come save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.97,0:09:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't grab you, someone, or I fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.97,0:10:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you're doing a great job!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.83,0:10:03.83,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\fnAdega Serif\b1\blur0.72\fs160\c&H08090C&\pos(960,871)}Three hours later...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.97,0:10:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.57,0:10:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.49,0:10:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strange this squid still has flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.41,0:10:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's said to have a taste that can\Nlast you for an entire lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.97,0:10:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's starting to feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.79,0:10:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been here for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.03,0:10:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is the bait holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.01,0:10:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.17,0:10:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't noticed any\Nmovement for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.41,0:10:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.95,0:10:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you fishing for squid?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.41,0:10:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Correct. You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.33,0:10:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not gonna work!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows squids are nocturnal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.37,0:10:36.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this how it ends?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.05,0:10:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'll find a way to endure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.55,0:10:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That squid has to die first, and then\NI will finally bust those heretics.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.07,0:10:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look! Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.21,0:10:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.83,0:11:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Celebrate later! Save me first!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.23,0:11:12.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been treasuring this precious\Nnut since our lady gifted it to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.77,0:11:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now it seems to have dried up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.43,0:11:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.75,0:11:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a nut.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.35,0:11:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fear this may mean that something\Nawful has happened to the premiere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.23,0:11:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The look on your face says\Nsomething, but it's not fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.35,0:11:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although you are kind\Nof scaring me right now.
