Dialogue: 2,0:11:26.96,0:11:31.96,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnDraconian Mechanical Pencil\b1\c&H3E895C&\fs80\blur0.7\pos(1388.8,150.4)}You can't chew \Nthrough the legs, \Nso you can chew \Nthem for \Na lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.21,0:11:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, the flavor lasts a lifetime,\Nso you can keep chewing and chewing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.69,0:11:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this is the last thing I'll\Never see, I'm glad it's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.39,0:11:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, time to prep the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.89,0:11:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.81,0:11:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.73,0:11:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.67,0:11:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks, Bast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.71,0:11:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe if we put up a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.85,0:11:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who am I kidding?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.48,0:11:47.44,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H3364FD&\3c&H3364FD&\blur0.7\fs175\bord7\fnCloudy\b0\pos(1461.34,331.33)}Eate{\3c&H5170F7&\c&H5170F7&}n
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.48,0:11:47.44,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H1B2450&\3c&H3364FD&\blur0.7\fs175\bord0\fnCloudy\b0\pos(1461.34,331.33)}Eate{\c&H2D335E&}n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.77,0:11:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna eat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.81,0:11:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or strangle me!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.98,0:11:48.94,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H4868FF&\3c&H4868FF&\blur0.7\fs125\bord6\fnCloudy\b0\frz13.26\pos(452.14,863.19)}Crushed \Nto Death
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.98,0:11:48.94,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H272F5B&\3c&H4868FF&\blur0.7\fs125\bord0\fnCloudy\b0\frz13.26\pos(452.14,863.19)}Crushed \Nto Death
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.97,0:11:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or drown me!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.48,0:11:50.48,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H5A7AF8&\3c&H5A7AF8&\blur0.7\fs125\bord6\fnCloudy\b0\frz4.26\pos(1258.54,184.79)}Suffo{\c&H5A7AF8&\3c&H5A7AF8&}c{*\c&H607BF3&\3c&H607BF3&}a{*\c&H677CEF&\3c&H677CEF&}t{*\c&H6D7DEA&\3c&H6D7DEA&}i{*\c&H747EE6&\3c&H747EE6&}o{\c&H7B80E2&\3c&H7B80E2&}n
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.48,0:11:50.48,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H272854&\3c&H456BFF&\blur0.7\fs125\bord0\fnCloudy\b0\frz4.26\pos(1258.54,184.79)}Suffo{\c&H272854&}c{*\c&H302F57&}a{*\c&H3A375B&}t{*\c&H433F5E&}i{*\c&H4D4762&}o{\c&H574F66&}n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.49,0:11:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or something worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.61,0:11:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.53,0:11:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.95,0:11:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at the tentacles of a squid!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.37,0:11:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.89,0:12:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the way the food chain works.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.47,0:12:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.95,0:12:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humans are supposed to eat you\Nguys, not the other way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.59,0:12:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need a little\Nbreak from talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.09,0:12:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and of course we had to pick\Nnow to be in the middle of a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.11,0:12:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, this\Nis a lot like back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.23,0:12:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you're my only hope, Jinguuji!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.65,0:12:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried, I really did, but I can't\Nunderstand a word the teacher says, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.03,0:12:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, you gotta help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.55,0:12:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're failing because\Nyou sleep through class.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.91,0:12:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your own fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.03,0:12:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've got a part-time job!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.13,0:12:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.05,0:12:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, these are life\Nor death stakes here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.29,0:12:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My summer vacation is on the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.27,0:12:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.47,0:12:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how bad are your grades?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.87,0:12:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super bad.
