Dialogue: 3,0:12:43.66,0:12:45.66,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\c&HE4E7F3&\fs100\fax0.4\blur1.25\fnPervitina Dex\pos(1560,504)}Seizariya
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.35,0:12:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the last time, explain it to\Nme in a way that I can understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.59,0:12:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to help you stop yelling at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.91,0:12:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.61,0:12:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is why you asked for my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.45,0:12:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can go over it again, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.45,0:12:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And focus this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.07,0:13:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We both know all you need\Nto do is apply yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.17,0:13:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we'll start\Nback at the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.67,0:13:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.45,0:13:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.61,0:13:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're good at everything\Nand I'm just a loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.63,0:13:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tachibana!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.15,0:13:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stupid, useless eggplant!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.19,0:13:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never want to speak to you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.41,0:13:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what? Eggplant?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.53,0:13:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so, the two friends did not speak\Nto each other for a little over a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.35,0:13:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which made school not the\Nleast bit awkward, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.77,0:13:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that, and I still lost my summer\Nvacation to make up tests and extra lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.43,0:13:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.35,0:13:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really on my own and\NI still don't have a plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.21,0:13:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.93,0:13:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.05,0:13:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I need to do is charm them and\Nthey'll turn against each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.53,0:13:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have to get this thing off my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.51,0:13:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.67,0:13:56.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.87,0:13:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop shaking the cage!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.83,0:14:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jake!
