Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.27,0:14:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, who forgot to lock the cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.97,0:14:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, that was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.07,0:14:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, she all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.23,0:14:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you even listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.31,0:14:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.41,0:14:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think it'd put\Nup this big of a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.55,0:14:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you had a plan,\Ndidn't you? Somewhat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.51,0:14:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assumed I could just\Nyank it out of the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.67,0:14:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you assume that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.65,0:14:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.73,0:14:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is my strength failing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.47,0:14:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My diet is still perfectly balanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.51,0:14:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I keep up with my morning routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.05,0:14:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see no reason why I should\Nbe struggling with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.07,0:14:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why is everything off?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.87,0:14:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.27,0:14:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.73,0:14:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring her down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.03,0:14:52.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, settle down! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.19,0:14:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a moth?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.73,0:14:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.65,0:14:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.56,0:14:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's nothing but a witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.11,0:15:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That tart tried to steal\Nmy husband from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.49,0:15:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goddess!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.41,0:15:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want at least three children with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.29,0:15:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pick me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.21,0:15:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want at least four!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.12,0:15:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.03,0:15:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This girl is meant to be an\Noffering to the squid gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.43,0:15:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.35,0:15:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does the worst stuff\Nalways have to happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.79,0:15:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough with this self-pity\Nalready, you home-wrecking tramp!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.79,0:15:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those crocodile tears\Nmay work on our husbands,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.01,0:15:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they won't have any effect on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.91,0:15:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you've never done an\Nhonest day's work in your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.59,0:15:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beauty is such a burden, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.83,0:15:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your existence is reason enough\Nfor us to burn you at the stake!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.19,0:15:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear, hear! Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.35,0:15:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.57,0:15:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause there's no way I'm dying here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.87,0:15:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how dare you judge me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.63,0:15:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't done anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.91,0:15:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While you guys do human\Nsacrifice and for what? Squid?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.37,0:15:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a bunch of idiot murderers!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.25,0:15:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you badmouth\Nour precious village!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.57,0:15:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.49,0:15:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is a witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.40,0:15:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's cursing us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.31,0:15:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that girl on\Nthe tower is your companion!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.01,0:15:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.93,0:15:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You actually think I'm like\Nthis because I want to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.71,0:15:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's easy to judge people by\Ntheir looks or your opinions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.61,0:16:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stand there randomly deciding what a\Nprison's worth and why, because it's fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.71,0:16:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not the problem here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.61,0:16:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't put your baggage on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.55,0:16:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like, what human sacrifice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.11,0:16:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not just make it a\Nlife-size doll and give it that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.77,0:16:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not very shy with her opinions, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.33,0:16:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.79,0:16:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never has been, never will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.17,0:16:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.09,0:16:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yubana, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a guess!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.75,0:16:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm seconds away from being slaughtered!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.09,0:16:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.65,0:16:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hold on for much longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.31,0:16:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, hurry up and get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.43,0:16:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And do something about this\Nangry mob before they belay me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.61,0:16:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.67,0:16:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.03,0:16:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.97,0:17:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fake girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.81,0:17:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think she's alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.39,0:17:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how long an\Nelf could survive in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.79,0:17:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's tougher than she seems to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.71,0:17:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.13,0:17:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't abandon your\Nresponsibility like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.57,0:17:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's in there because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.59,0:17:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why, great squid god?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.17,0:17:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.69,0:17:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always minding my own business\Nsince you're in a womanly snag.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.17,0:17:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then all of a sudden, I'm\Nperceiving you right, you pervy squid!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.35,0:17:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.61,0:17:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're quite the cutie, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.51,0:17:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, don't even think\Nabout it, Slimeball. Cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.55,0:17:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna eat you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.85,0:17:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I'm almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.59,0:17:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost is not cutting it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.77,0:17:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.47,0:17:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At long last, I will see your demise!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.81,0:18:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come and let us die together!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.09,0:18:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.07,0:18:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, you weirdo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.51,0:18:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit trying to get us killed and\Nfinish off this creepy squid!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.87,0:18:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.95,0:18:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Premier! Use this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.13,0:18:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.03,0:18:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was so cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.33,0:18:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew that Damascus knife was sharp,\Nbut what you did was something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.39,0:18:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, thank you for saving me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.51,0:18:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pain is unbearable!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.21,0:18:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cruel, queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.19,0:19:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm. Tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.21,0:19:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I saw that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.13,0:19:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's plenty to go around,\Nso stop ogling my piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.07,0:19:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's just you're eating our god, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.51,0:19:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think a god tastes this good?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.57,0:19:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is nothing more than\Ndelicious giant squid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.57,0:19:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.93,0:19:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heatery.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.01,0:19:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miggy, it seems we've been beaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.79,0:19:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My good people, I ask you, is it right to\Nsacrifice a life to appease a giant squid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.87,0:19:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see now that we were wrong, for\Nwe are not squids, we are human!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.89,0:19:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's never come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.39,0:19:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I think we're all in agreement that\Nthis elf shall be our next village head.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.83,0:19:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, I leveled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.29,0:19:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.51,0:19:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you sure adopted quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.25,0:20:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a good thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.37,0:20:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone seems happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.95,0:20:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.21,0:20:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, so... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.93,0:20:12.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.63,0:20:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.07,0:20:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your notebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.91,0:20:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, I completely\Nforgot about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.25,0:20:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, I'm over it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.17,0:20:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm more surprised that you\Nhad something to be embarrassed about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.63,0:20:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you're sort of human after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.77,0:20:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only sort of?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.41,0:20:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still curious what it was that\Nyou just had to keep me from seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.11,0:20:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no getting back the\Ninfo you scribbled over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.55,0:20:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh, maybe you can show me your own\Nnotebook once we get back to our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.73,0:20:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don't have it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.35,0:20:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My grandmother threw it out a while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.21,0:20:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.13,0:20:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's unfortunate. It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.43,0:20:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.29,0:20:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't leave me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.19,0:20:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.05,0:21:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take your eyes off me for\Neven a moment and I might die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.03,0:21:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.71,0:21:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that a marriage proposal I heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.65,0:21:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Village head! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.35,0:21:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Village head! I said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.37,0:21:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, we desperately need your guidance!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.61,0:21:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.53,0:21:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop chasing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.71,0:21:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.49,0:21:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.63,0:21:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They ate it! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.01,0:21:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The smell is making my mouth\Nwater even this far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.59,0:21:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go try some.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.99,0:21:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can make do with\Nthe dried squid we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.17,0:21:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, when those two showed up, I had\Na suspicion they'd upend our plan somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.63,0:21:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet they surprised me anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.47,0:21:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.13,0:21:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way we'd beat Four-Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.27,0:21:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was able to defeat me after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.29,0:21:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you bragging about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.07,0:21:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In any case, we finished our\Nbusiness here, so we should leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.47,0:21:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.39,0:21:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least we can bring back\Nsome squid for the demon lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.37,0:22:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So his strength decreases\Nwhen they become separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.15,0:22:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.25,0:22:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That gives me a delicious idea.
